  "description": "Replacement of all windows and glazed French doors at the property which is a sympathetic enhancement.   The new windows and French doors will replicate the existing sash design exactly the same and will be virtually indistinguishable from the originals ensuring that the property’s character, look and feel remains intact and maintained. \nThe property is neither listed nor individually protected and the proposed works will preserve the existing character maintain visual integrity while delivering energy efficiency improvements, better durability and security. \nThere are already precedents on the street with UPVC installed windows, most notably Tall Trees which is the property immediately next door.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
